{
  "description": "The proposed works comprise the construction of a single-storey extension to the existing dwelling, an extension to the existing bathroom to provide additional internal space, and the formation of a new patio area to improve the external amenity space. The proposals also include the provision of a small roof-level storage area.\n\nThe existing garage was in poor and unsafe condition and was considered dangerous to use. The existing garage structure has therefore been demolished, and the garage is proposed to be rebuilt in accordance with the submitted drawings. The works will provide a safe and functional replacement garage while maintaining the existing use of the property.",
